cycle means we reach to starting element again after whole graph traversal.

UNDIRECTED GRAPH : there is min 3 element required , two element will not form any cycle. 
  concept : parent node should be ignore . 
    condition for cycle : vis[neigh] == true (1) and neigh != parent then cycle is there. else apply dfs to unvisited element. 


DIRECTED GRAPH : even 2 element can form cycle 0 to 1 and  1 to 0, 
concept : parent concept fail here (may or may not be edge b/w dest to souce) , introduce new concept of path array along with visited array.


